{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "4720534c-97f7-82cc-ae36-76157ba6e890",
  "created_at": "2026-02-27T13:10:58-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Rui Amaral",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T13:04:45-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. Good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T13:04:50-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi. [pause] Yes. Good afternoon. I want to report something. [pause] About trash."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T13:04:59-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, go ahead. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T13:05:04-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A neighbor. [pause] Keeps dumping bags. [pause] At the corner. Black trash bags."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T13:05:13-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Where's the corner? Can you give me the address or the nearest one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T13:05:23-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is by my house. [pause] Four eleven Spring Street. [pause] The corner right next to it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T13:05:34-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-eleven Spring Street, in the Fifth Ward. Got it. And how many bags are we talking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T13:05:45-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Maybe six. [pause] Seven. Some are open. [pause] They were not there Monday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T13:05:54-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So they showed up sometime this week. And you know it's a neighbor, you've seen them do it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T13:06:06-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. [pause] I saw him. Twice. [pause] Evening. He carries them out. [pause] Puts them down. Leaves."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T13:06:17-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'll write that down. I won't put a name in the report unless you want to give one, I just need the location and what's there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T13:06:34-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No name. [pause] I do not know it. Just the house. [pause] Next door, the one with the green porch."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T13:06:47-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Green porch next to four-eleven. That helps. Is anything blocking the sidewalk or the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T13:06:57-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A little. [pause] The sidewalk. People walk around. [pause] In the street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T13:07:05-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, I'll note that too so it gets looked at sooner. Is it just household trash, or is there furniture, construction stuff, anything like that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T13:07:21-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just bags. [pause] Kitchen trash I think. [pause] It smells."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T13:07:28-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll send this over to the crew that handles pickups of illegal dumping, and someone may also check the bags to see if there's anything that points back to where they came from."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T13:07:50-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. [pause] Is there a fee? [pause] For me. For picking up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T13:07:58-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, not for you. You're reporting it, you're not being charged anything. If they trace it to somebody, that's a matter for that person, not you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T13:08:15-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. [pause] Thank you. [pause] I was not sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T13:08:21-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's a fair question. Now, do you want a call back once it's been picked up, or just leave it be?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T13:08:35-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A call back. [pause] Is okay. [pause] Hold on. [pause] My phone battery. Three percent."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T13:08:45-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, okay. Do you have a charger close?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T13:08:51-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Across the room. [pause] It is far. [pause] The cord is short."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T13:08:59-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, let's be quick then. I'll just confirm your number so I have it. Is it four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-eight-oh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T13:09:12-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. [pause] That is it. [pause] Oh one eight oh."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T13:09:19-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. And your name for the report?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T13:09:24-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Rui Amaral. [pause] R, U, I. [pause] Amaral. A, M, A, R, A, L."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T13:09:33-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Rui Amaral. Got it. So that's bags piled at the corner beside four-eleven Spring Street, partly on the sidewalk, reported Friday. I'll send it over this afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T13:09:50-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. [pause] How long? [pause] Until they come?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T13:09:56-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Usually a few days, it depends how busy they are. Could be sooner since it's blocking the walk. If you don't see anyone by the middle of next week, call back and mention today's report."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T13:10:18-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. [pause] Next week. [pause] I will call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T13:10:24-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And in the meantime, I'd leave the bags alone. Don't move them or open them yourself."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T13:10:35-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. [pause] I will not touch. [pause] Okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T13:10:41-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Go plug that phone in, Mr. Amaral."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T13:10:47-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. [pause] I will. Thank you. [pause] Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T13:10:53-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bye now. Have a good weekend."
    }
  ],
